<title>USA: Solv-Ex names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Solv-Ex names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solv-Ex Corp on Wednesday said J. Brad Steward was named vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Steward joins the company from KPMG Peat Marwick LLP, where he spent 12 years serving clients in a range of services including cash management, cost controls, information systems and accounting and reporting.</p>
<p>Solv-Ex officials were not immediately available to say who he was replacing as chief financial officer.</p>
